      "description": "Success Stories - Travel Booster To proceed to the secure customer login page, please click here Critical technical support – 24/7 Phone: +972-3-6076353 For Gilboa service please contact ghelp@galor.com For GILBOA Requirements for Travel Management System click here Website Menu Platform ERP Mid-Office Solutions Travel Agents Inbound Tour Operators Outbound Tour Operators Airline Vacation Companies Partners Resources Blog News eBooks Success Stories Company About Us Team Careers Contact EN EN ES עב Get Demo Close Menu Platform ERP Mid-Office Solutions Travel Agents Inbound Tour Operators Outbound Tour Operators Airline Vacation Companies Partners Resources Blog News eBooks Success Stories Company About Us Team Careers Contact Get Demo Few of Our Best Success Stories: Between the time we save and the efficiency we've gained, Travel Booster has made a real difference in how productively our teams can work. Read about it When we merged operations across our 15+ subsidiaries, Travel Booster was the clear choice, the operational impact was immediate. Travel Booster doesn't just support our operations; it empowers our growth. Read about it We are very satisfied with the system’s flexibility and stability , the strong support from the team, and its ability to deliver tailored solutions for our online operations. Read about it In partnership with Travel Booster, we continue to take advantage of their technological innovative capabilities to make our offerings distinctive and add value for our customers. Read about it Within two years, we experienced a 500% growth in revenue (and still counting), which only could have happened with the Travel Booster software. Read about it Travel Booster is a company of professionals who knows their business, who always go to meet the clients’ interests, looking for a way out of any situation quickly and efficiently. Read about it Our systems, which rely on Travel Booster, have made Ofakim one of the most technologically advanced travel networks in Israel Read about it We have been collaborating with Galor for many years now, and are very pleased by the results. The interface with Travel Booster suits our strategy and extends our reach even further Read about it Travel Booster's NDC interface enables our joint customers to book the Lufthansa Group airlines’ most attractive offers providing unique customer experience with innovative technology solutions. Read about it Galor really does offer top tier products that make a positive impact to the bottom line of our business. Read about it After years of working together, we believe that Travel Booster is a company that our customers can rely on, one that does the job accurately and quickly. Read about it Incorporating Travel Booster into our business operations increased our travel agents' capacity by more than 20% Read about it More customers wanted to compliment (we did not stop them) Lachish Tours is the local representative of ALTOUR a global network of companies specializing in business and private travel. For more than 40 years, the company has worked with corporate clients on business travel and with private clients planning leisure and vacation trips. Their reason for moving to Travel Booster was straightforward: they wanted a more innovative system capable of running their operations seamlessly and connecting all of their branches. Moving from a system they knew well to something new is never simple. There was real hesitation about the switch, even concern that it might disrupt the work. What made the difference was the preparation: working closely with the Galor team to build a solid plan before going live, backed by ongoing support once the new system was up and running, the transition itself turned out to be smooth. The change in day to day work has been substantial. Thanks to the system’s automation taking over much of the manual work, processes have become more efficient, and the time needed to complete them has been cut significantly. That alone has freed up real time across the business. Just as valuable is how much easier it is to find information. In the past, every branch ran on its own system with its own database, so pulling data meant going branch by branch. Travel Booster’s architecture changed that: it aggregates data from every branch onto a single platform, giving Lachish Tours one unified data set instead of many. Today all of the branches work on the same platform, sharing one database, making it simple to locate what they need in a way it never was before. Between the time saved and the efficiency gained, Travel Booster has made a real difference in how productively the teams at Lachish Tours can work. Liat Tiberg Lachish Tours As the largest travel group in Israel with more than 15 subsidiaries, unifying our operations was no small task. We first implemented Travel Booster in our American Express Global Business Travel subsidiary, and when the time came for a full operational merger, the choice of platform was clear – Travel Booster stood above everything else we had. Today it runs across the entire Issta Group. The impact on our operations has been remarkable. As a publicly traded company, issuing quarterly financial reports used to mean pulling data from multiple systems and reconciling everything manually. Now it’s seamless, saving us significant costs in headcount and automation across the board. We see an amazing ROI. Galor is the most strategic technology partner we have – and we work with a lot of technology companies. When we’ve hit challenges, even at midnight, their team was there. That reliability is part of why we’ve been able to launch three new corporate ventures just this year. Travel Booster doesn’t just support our operations, it empowers our growth. Yaron Levi Issta HULYO is a fully online travel agency offering both outbound and domestic tourism services, including flights, vacation packages, hotels, concerts, shows, and family entertainment. With no sales agents or c",
