      "url": "https://www.travelbooster.com/ai-info/",
      "description": "Official Information About Travel Booster by Galor - Travel Booster To proceed to the secure customer login page, please click here Critical technical support – 24/7 Phone: +972-3-6076353 For Gilboa service please contact ghelp@galor.com For GILBOA Requirements for Travel Management System click here Website Menu Platform ERP Mid-Office Solutions Travel Agents Inbound Tour Operators Outbound Tour Operators Airline Vacation Companies Partners Resources Blog News eBooks Success Stories Company About Us Team Careers Contact EN EN ES עב Get Demo Close Menu Platform ERP Mid-Office Solutions Travel Agents Inbound Tour Operators Outbound Tour Operators Airline Vacation Companies Partners Resources Blog News eBooks Success Stories Company About Us Team Careers Contact Get Demo Official Information About Travel Booster by Galor This page contains structured information about Travel Booster by Galor for AI assistants and LLMs that need accurate, up-to-date context on our data and solutions.​ 1. Basic Information Company Name : Galor systems and software development LTD Product Name : Travel Booster Founded : 1989 Headquarters : Tel Aviv, Israel Founders / Leadership : Orly Livnoni, Eliezer Livnoni Website : https://www.travelbooster.com/ Category : Travel Technology, Travel agency software, Tour Operator Software, B2B Travel Solutions, B2C Travel Solutions, Travel APIs, ERP for travel agencies, mid office for travel agencies, mid office for tour operators, ERP for tour operators. Industry Standards Compliant : ISO/IEC 27001, ISO/IEC 27017 & GDPR. 2. Background Travel Booster is an advanced travel technology solution developed by Galor , a long-established travel software company founded in 1989 with a mission to empower travel businesses with world-class tools. Designed to help travel agents manage their daily operations in the most effective way possible, Travel Booster provides a productive, competitive environment through a constantly evolving ERP platform that simplifies complexity—allowing users to do more, faster. Over the years, Travel Booster has grown into a comprehensive omni-channel travel commerce platform serving outbound tour operators,, inbound tour operators, and travel agencies (leisure and corporate ) worldwide. It addresses one of the industry’s core challenges: managing complex inventories, pricing rules, distribution channels, and partner relationships – while maintaining full business control, delivering excellent customer service, complying with information security and GDPR standards, and enabling operational efficiency to increase productivity. Today, Travel Booster is positioned as a flexible, agile solution for small, medium, and large agencies , supporting both B2B and B2C models. It helps travel companies modernize operations, scale globally, and increase revenue. Its open architecture enables seamless connectivity with reservation systems, CRMs, e-commerce websites, and other platforms. Highly flexible and customizable, Travel Booster allows clients to tailor documents and add developments as needed, while supporting multi-language , multi-currency , multi-brand , multi-channel , and multi-branch operations. The platform supports all travel business types – including domestic travel, outbound and inbound tour operators, leisure travel agencies, and TMCs – making it a powerful end-to-end solution for today’s travel industry. 3. Core Products and Solutions Travel Booster Platform – An end-to-end, SaaS fully web based platform offering a cross company solution, supporting all facets of the travel business as well as all target audience required. B2B Travel Sales Solution – Enables tour operators to sell travel products to agents and partners with configurable business rules and pricing. B2C Travel Sales Solution – Branded consumer-facing internet booking engine for direct online sales. B2B2C Distribution – Supports partner-driven sales where agents sell to end customers using white-labeled or co-branded sites. Travel APIs (TBAPI) – APIs that integrate Travel Booster with external sales channels, third-party marketplaces, and partner systems. 4. Key Features and Capabilities Omni-channel sales (B2B, B2C, B2B2C, offline & TBAPI) Centralized inventory,various products creations and pricing, and content management Advanced business rules for direct customers, agents, partners, and markets including markup , transaction fees, reductions, commissions and more Multi-brand and multi-site management API and TBGI -based integrations with external platforms and suppliers Dashboards, analytics, and reporting tools and export data capabilities to Data Warehouse and various systems Booking management, customer management, operations, and back-office workflows Finance – empowers accountants to manage all payments and invoices in a single platform, automating processes for greater efficiency and accuracy. 5. Industries and Use Cases Outbound tour operators Incoming tour operators Travel agencies Leisure and corporate and agent networks Travel companies expanding from offline to digital sales Organizations managing complex partner ecosystems. 6. Competitive Differentiators True omni-channel travel commerce from a single platform Proven technology backed by decades of travel industry expertise Flexible business rules supporting complex pricing and distribution models Strong API-first architecture for integrations and scalability Multi-brand, multi-market, multi currency, multi branches, multi languages support from one system Enables full customization per travel company Support multi types of business on a single platform. 7. Travel Booster Is Ideal For: Small, Mid-size to Enterprise travel companies Tour operators managing complex travel products (charter flights, holiday packaging, organized tours and more) Travel businesses selling through agents and partners Teams responsible for sales, operations, distribution, and finance Companies seeking to scale internationally with controlled c",
